<item><title>Cape Verde drops three places to 71st in FIFA ranking</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-drops-three-places-to-71st-in-fifa-ranking-2d6dce/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cv/cape-verde-drops-three-places-to-71st-in-fifa-ranking-2d6dce/</guid><category>Cabo Verde</category><description>The team remains the highest-ranked Portuguese-speaking country, with 1,360.08 points in the latest update.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:27:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" length="34079" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cv.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
